      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article presents an overview of some of the behavioral and psychosocial issues involved in the care of TMJ and orofacial pain patients. The importance of a thorough pretreatment assessment is emphasized. Treatment options for oral habits, stress management, and other psychosocial challenges are briefly discussed."},
